Uses for gems:

 * Hard gems can be used to engrave the E-word.

 * Valuable gems may be tossed to unicorns for luck.  Properly
   identified gems are significantly better here (+5 vs. +2).

 * Identified gems may be sold in shops and then stolen back by pets.
   This is much faster and easier than credit cloning.

 * Extra score when ascending (or escaping).

 * May be used as missile weapons (even glass!).

